  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Biodiversity and Geodiversity Resilience in the Caribbean SIDS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Addressing the urgent environmental issues faced by Caribbean SIDS, this initiative aims to fortify the region&apos;s resilience against climate change, biodiversity loss, cultural erosion and economic instability. By reinforcing biocultural territories with biosphere reserves and geo-parks, promoting environmental education, and balancing conservation efforts with economic activities, it aims to elevate resilience and prosperity within communities dependent on the region&apos;s natural resources and ecosystems.</narrative>
  </description>
